tes (identity, third_party, bands[1], amounts, dates, notes, multi_product, phrases, promise_write, outcomes) to cite the full constraining sentences; no values were changed because all extracted values matched the specification and the API enums."], "audit_unresolved": ["Floor rounding is 'nearest whole cent'; the percent floor rule has no rounding-mode field.", "Hardship sympathy sentence wording is not dictated; 'I am sorry to hear that.' is a written-to-content sentence.", "Refusal to talk has no dedicated close pair; outcome follows the general precedence.", "Prohibition on offering discounts, waivers or new instalment plans has no IR field."], "defaulted_without_source": []}
